se 'a': printf(\"1\"); break;\n     case 'b': printf(\"2\");\n     case 'c': printf(\"3\"); break;\n   }\n   ```\n   * **Answer:** `23`\n\n10. **What happens if two case labels in the same switch have the same constant value?**\n    * **Answer:** Compile-time error\n\n11. **Where can the default label be placed inside a \n<truncated 6518 bytes>\ni extracted all 20 answers from `defaultQuiz` in `index.html`. Fixed by completely deleting `defaultQuiz` from `index.html` and fetching only over the network.\n   - *Firestore Submission Rejection Risk*: Fixed by strictly restricting payload to the 11 allowed keys and adding `maxlength=\"99\"`.\n\n5. **Active Context**\n   - Current files in workspace `C:\\Users\\CxAdmin\\Desktop\\Exploit`:\n     - `index.html`\n     - `teacher.html`\n     - `firebase-config.js`\n     - `vercel.json`\n     - `HISTORY.md`\n     - `QUIZ06 (1) (1).html` (unmodified original)\n   - Scratch test scripts stored in `<appDataDir>\\brain\\8f2bd4b5-d81b-4839-aa40-a5c3a5acaa6a\\scratch\\`.\n\n6. **Next Steps**\n   - Update `HISTORY.md` to document the removal of `defaultQuiz` from `firebase-config.js` as Non-Major Patch 1.0.10.\n   - Check if `defaultQuiz` should also be purged from `teacher.html` (lines 141-174) so that no hardcoded answer keys remain in any workspace file.\n   - Re-verify zero in-code comments using `verify_code.mjs` across all files.\n   - Formulate clean response reporting completion of `defaultQuiz` removal from `firebase-config.js`.\n\n7. **Commitments & Constraints**\n   - **Zero In-Code Comments (Rule 9)**: Absolutely no `//`, `/* */`, `<!-- -->` in modified executable code.\n   - **Changelog Maintenance (Rule 1)**: Must add new non-major patch entries below existing entries in `HISTORY.md`.\n   - **Preserve Uncode Original (Rule 2 & 12)**: Do not modify `QUIZ06 (1) (1).html`.\n</summary>\n\nYou have the 1 following artifacts written to the artifacts directory:\n\n[ARTIFACT: implementation_plan]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/CxAdmin